{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-09", "pageid": 56398, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-08\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-10\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.89.E4.B8.80.E5.BE.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"三一律\">三一律</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 三一律</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我看到了文字背后的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>知识从前人的脑中流淌至笔尖，而后铺满纸页，装订成册，得以传承。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这与6的命运相同，我以不同的方式从他人身上继承智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当你凝视它，它便不再拥有完整的形态。“智慧”是被硬赋予的名——它本是人类这个种群庞杂思绪的集合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我与山中盗贼痛饮美酒，我与英雄乘过了同一叶扁舟，我将智者们邀请至身边，与他们辩论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我从书上阅读，如同窥视他人颅骨内的思想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>逐渐将这些思绪握在掌心，我却发现无论其间的曲线多么复杂，它们都只有两端。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一端是“生”，另一端是“死”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为这就是人的命运。我们正如纺锤上的麻绳，虽有万般变化，但终究是有限的集合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而世上注定有纷争，注定有不幸和灾厄。好人并不一定因为他们的德行受到嘉奖，恶人也并不一定因为他们的罪行受到惩罚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，一切只是发生，如沙滩上被冲刷的卵石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>只能，如此了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那时的夜更黑，连海面上的粼光也被黑夜吞没，我感觉脚下的沙地正在流逝，而我和我的一切开始浮空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切色彩都褪去了，我在空旷的黑色空间中悬浮着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那天，艾尔玛想要见我。我合上《生存空虚说》，在长久的闭关之后第一次离开了房间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_xuepaigonggongqu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我回到有顶的家，攀上山坡，远离海的边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>艾尔玛拽住我的手，她听说了我的近况，担心我落入知识的虚无之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我猜中了她要对我说的每一句话——6的智慧，古老的箴言，《金言》的劝导，我早已听过无数遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我并不责怪她，这是6的职责，也是她的命运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我拂开了她的手，回到我自己的战场中去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使知识会导向虚无，我也需要用它来面对那未知的“启示”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有谁拦住了我，是210。我听到他情绪激烈，口中提到的正是“启示”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>那是诅咒，我的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我本不应回答，因为这并非他的命运。他总是试图染指远超自己能力之事，这会为他带来灾厄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谨慎的代达罗斯和骄傲的伊卡洛斯同时给自己装上翅膀，试图飞跃大海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前者在不高的空中安全落地，后者则迎着太阳高飞，最终在烈阳的洗礼中坠落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不难看出他属于哪一种。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人进入了我的闭关处，是37。她总是好奇，也总是感到不解和疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好在，她总是坚信自己是对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……很抱歉，37。我暂时没有办法帮助你解决这个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我可以回答她，因为我比她疑惑得更早，更深。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我可以提供许多智慧的解答，可这些对她或许是百害而无一利的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海洋女神忒提斯将她的儿子阿基里斯放入冥河中浸泡，让其拥有不死之身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为冥河水流湍急，这位母亲捏住婴儿的脚后跟不敢松手。她的爱让脚踵成为阿基里斯唯一的致命弱点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不难看出37的弱点在何处。至少，我不应提前揭开它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我重新关上门，静坐于缄默之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那我又是谁呢？我又属于哪一个寓言？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，我也知晓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——俄狄浦斯经历了他的挣扎，迎来了预言中的厄运。于是，十全十美的悲剧诞生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都清清楚楚，明明白白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……现在我都知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-512701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>可是，这之后又要怎么办呢？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-09"}}